This directory contains a modified copy of google/embeddinggemma-2
(https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-2), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Changes: text-only (vision and audio encoders removed), exported to ONNX with mean pooling and
L2 normalisation built in. The fp32 weights are stored as their upper 16 bits (bf16, which is
the precision Google released) plus a small fix-up table, split into < 100 MB parts; they are
rebuilt bit-exactly on first run. See scripts/export_model.py. README.md is the original model card.
